ready: 1
kind: quality
id: memory.quality.atomic-write
display_id: QC-MEMORY-ATOMIC
module: memory
title: Every memory change is atomic and traceable
applies_to:
  - memory.seq.write
  - memory.seq.update
  - memory.seq.revise-belief
measure: >-
  After a crash or error at any point in a write, update, or revision, whether the memory row,
  its version, its links, and its change row disagree with each other.
target: >-
  Never. Either all four are committed or none are, and a retried call with the same operation
  id applies once.
